, "display_name": "Create_Credential", "entity_type": "credential", "ext_id": "16497522-ec49-40c6-5e3f-664cc788cf40", "last_updated_time": "2026-10-14T07:25:52.692091+00:00", "links": null, "migration_action_notes": {"notes": null}, "operation_type": "EXTERNAL", "related_operation_list": null, "tenant_id": null}, {"allow_on_shared_entity": null, "associated_endpoint_list": [{"api_version": "V4", "endpoint_url": "/config/unified-namespaces", "http_method": "POST"}], "client_name": "Files", "created_time": "2026-10-14T07:25:52.841528+00:00", "description": "Creates a new unified namespace with multiple member file servers and single core member.\n\nThe users need to specify the list of member file servers and a single core member\nto be part of unified namespace inside the request body.\n\nFor external file server, user needs to provide migration source which \ncontains details of external file server\n", "display_name": "Create_File_Server_Unified_Namespace", "entity_type": "files", "ext_id": "1631a46f-854b-4105-5a66-4e86709f0ae2", "last_updated_time": "2026-10-14T07:26:01.365885+00:00", "links": null, "migration_action_notes": {"notes": null}, "operation_type": "EXTERNAL", "related_operation_list": ["959598cd-af72-48c2-46df-3d60180245b0", "af9f3fef-33b2-4775-40f8-2322737ec495"], "tenant_id": null}, {"allow_on_shared_entity": null, "associated_endpoint_list": [{"api_version": "V4", "endpoint_url": "/config/replication-policies", "http_method": "POST"}], "client_name": "Files", "created_time": "2026-10-14T07:25:52.841693+00:00", "description": "Creates a new replication policy between a file server pair(s) by using the provided request body.\n\nThe users need to specify the `name` and `type` of the replication along with\nreplication configuration details inside the request body.\nThe user also needs to provide at least one replication configuration inside the request body, which contains `primaryfileServerExtId`,\n`replicationEntities`, an array of `pathOfPrimaryFileServerMountTarget` strings, and replication `schedule`.\nAll schedules, and status should be consistent across all replicationConfigurations.\nFor example, if one replicationConfiguration is enabled, all replicationConfigurations should be enabled.\n\nUse dry-run workflow with same payload to validate the request. Normal workflow won't validate mount target paths, file servers reachability, fs version compatibility, etc before task creation.\n", "display_name": "Create_File_Server_Data_Protection_Policy", "entity_type": "files", "ext_id": "ed9202de-cfe4-4bf7-403e-53e12053efdc", "last_updated_time": "2026-10-14T07:26:02.281510+00:00", "links": null, "migration_action_notes": {"notes": null}, "operation_type": "EXTERNAL", "related_operation_list": ["959598cd-af72-48c2-46df-3d60180245b0", "a6abf56f-01b5-4faf-51c2-ee7e65e43b15", "27f21a77-55c4-427e-73d3-96998a294633", "9c946a6e-a154-4b50-73ad-3d30847315c6"], "tenant_id": null}, {"allow_on_shared_entity": null, "associated_endpoint_list": [{"api_version": "V4", "endpoint_url": "/config/file-servers/{fileServerExtId}/anti-virus-servers", "http_method": "POST"}], "client_name": "Files", "created_time": "2026-10-14T07:25:52.841753+00:00", "description": "Create a new antivirus server. Please refer model section to get more details about fields.", "display_name": "Create_File_Server_Antivirus_Server", "entity_type": "files", "ext_id": "232ba010-6f6b-4fca-6f82-97cf70fd5fee", "last_updated_time": "2026-10-14T07:26:01.796130+00:00", "links": null, "migration_action_notes": {"notes": null}, "operation_type": "EXTERNAL", "related_operation_list": ["4d3f9432-ce1f-468c-497b-846268023a5b"], "tenant_id": null}, {"allow_on_shared_entity": null, "associated_endpoint_list": [{"api_version": "V4", "endpoint_url": "/config/file-servers/{fileServerExtId}/mount-targets/{mountTargetExtId}/quota-policies", "http_method": "POST"}], "client_name": "Files", "created_time": "2026-10-14T07:25:52.841763+00:00", "description": "Create a quota policy by using the provided request body.\n\nSpecify a valid identifier of the mount target for which quota policy needs to be created.\n\nUsers can specify `type`, `enforcementType`, `principalName`, `principalType`, `sizeInGb` as part of the request body,\nif they want to create User level quota policy.\n\nUsers can specify `type`, `enforcementType`, `directories`, `sizeInGb` as part of the request body,\nif they want to create Directory level quota policy.\n\nUse dry-run workflow with same payload to validate the request. Normal workflow won't validate `principalName` and `principalType` for user level quota policy before task creation.\n", "display_name": "Create_Quota_Policy_File_Server_Share", "entity_type": "files", "ext_id": "ed117431-fb7f-4dae-6ce0-b346392d0a0d", "last_updated_time": "2026-10-14T07:26:01.354742+00:00", "links": null, "migration_action_notes": {"notes": null}, "operation_type": "EXTERNAL", "related_operation_list": ["904b8151-df78-43e7-55c6-37d951e230c0", "a6abf56f-01b5-4faf-51c2-ee7e65e43b15"], "tenant_id": null}, {"allow_on_shared_entity": null, "associated_endpoint_list": [{"api_version": "V4", "endpoint_url": "/config/file-servers/{fileServerExtId}/snapshot-policies", "http_method": "POST"}], "client_name": "Files", "created_time": "2026-10-14T07:25:52.841908+00:00", "description": "Creates a new snapshot policy using the provided request body", "display_name": "Create_File_Server_Self_Service_Restore_Snapshot_Schedules", "entity_type": "files", "ext_id": "493b5a2e-d747-4194-453e-9bcc604e61bf", "last_updated_time": "2026-10-14T07:26:01.955700+00:00", "links": null, "migration_action_notes": {"notes": null}, "operation_type": "EXTERNAL", "related_operation_list": ["959598cd-af72-48c2-46df-3d60180245b0"], "tenant_id": null}, {"allow_on_shared_entity": null, "associated_endpoint_list": [{"api_version": "V4", "endpoint_url": "/config/file-servers/{extId}/user-mapping", "http_method": "POST"}], "client_name": "Files", "created_time": "2026-10-14T0