ation for the file server.\n", "display_name": "Create_File_Server_Tiering_Config", "entity_type": "files", "ext_id": "a3e00ebb-8662-4062-483f-f6336ee6c88d", "last_updated_time": "2026-10-14T07:26:01.056467+00:00", "links": null, "migration_action_notes": {"notes": null}, "operation_type": "EXTERNAL", "related_operation_list": ["e41f8db3-575c-4ebe-6d29-3f2097aafc85"], "tenant_id": null}, {"allow_on_shared_entity": null, "associated_endpoint_list": [{"api_version": "V4", "endpoint_url": "/config/file-servers/{fileServerExtId}/mount-targets/{mountTargetExtId}/$actions/replicate-snapshot", "http_method": "POST"}], "client_name": "Files", "created_time": "2026-10-14T07:25:52.842568+00:00", "description": "Request for triggering the one-time replication of kBackup type of snapshot", "display_name": "Create_Replicate_Snapshot_File_Server_Share", "entity_type": "files", "ext_id": "a7e3eec4-c0b9-42f5-5672-94ee84e00d09", "last_updated_time": "2026-10-14T07:25:52.842568+00:00", "links": null, "migration_action_notes": {"notes": null}, "operation_type": "EXTERNAL", "related_operation_list": null, "tenant_id": null}, {"allow_on_shared_entity": null, "associated_endpoint_list": [{"api_version": "V4", "endpoint_url": "/config/file-servers/{fileServerExtId}/virus-scan-policies", "http_method": "POST"}], "client_name": "Files", "created_time": "2026-10-14T07:25:52.842661+00:00", "description": "Creates a new virus scan policy. Users can create a virus scan policy at the file-server level for all shares or an individual mount target.\nWhen no mountTargetReference is passed in the request body, a policy will be created for the file server.\nWhen mountTargetReference is passed in the body, the policy will be created for that specific mount target.\n", "display_name": "Create_File_Server_Virus_Scan_Policy", "entity_type": "files", "ext_id": "47d22cdc-5fd1-4e84-6a7e-95c7943c8310", "last_updated_time": "2026-10-14T07:26:01.868430+00:00", "links": null, "migration_action_notes": {"notes":